493
00:32:24,620 --> 00:32:26,020
Afirmativo oficial.

494
00:32:27,460 --> 00:32:28,360


495
00:32:37,170 --> 00:32:38,540
¿Qué tal, muchacho?

496
00:32:38,540 --> 00:32:39,600
¿Qué pasa acá?

497
00:32:39,600 --> 00:32:41,040
